\newlabel{tab:fireprotdb}{{3}{9}{FireProtDB benchmark results. Per-protein Spearman correlations and stabilizing variant recovery in top-20 predictions. Only proteins with $\geq $3 mutations and $\geq $1 stabilizing mutation are shown.\relax }{table.caption.15}{}}
